<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>DQ Side Salad — The Lightest Option on the Menu</h2>
  <p>The DQ Side Salad is the lightest food item on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a> at 90 calories before dressing. For guests who want a complete, balanced meal with a DQ entrée but do not want the calorie addition of fries or other fried sides, the Side Salad is the clear answer. It is available at DQ Grill &amp; Chill locations.</p>

  <h2>Side Salad vs. Regular Fries — The Calorie Case</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Side</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Side Salad</td><td class="price-cell">$3.29</td><td>90 cal (+ dressing)</td><td>Lightest possible side, fresh vegetables</td></tr><tr><td>Regular Fries (small)</td><td class="price-cell">$2.49</td><td>260 cal</td><td>Crispy, satisfying, lower price</td></tr><tr><td>Regular Fries (large)</td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>480 cal</td><td>Highest calorie standard side</td></tr><tr><td>Onion Rings</td><td class="price-cell">$3.29+</td><td>400+ cal</td><td>More indulgent, same price range</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

  <h2>Building the Lowest-Calorie DQ Meal</h2>
  <p>The Side Salad is the key to building the lowest-calorie complete meal at DQ:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/items/grilled-chicken-sandwich">Grilled Chicken Sandwich</a> (390 cal) + Side Salad (90 cal) + dressing (~60 cal) = approximately <strong>540 calories</strong></li>
    <li><a href="/items/original-cheeseburger">Original Cheeseburger</a> (400 cal) + Side Salad (90 cal) = approximately <strong>490–550 calories</strong> depending on dressing</li>
    <li>These combinations deliver a complete, satisfying DQ meal well under 600 calories</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Dressing Options</h2>
  <p>The Side Salad comes with dressing on the side. Common dressing options at DQ locations include Ranch, Italian, and Balsamic Vinaigrette. Ask your crew what is available at your specific location. Ranch adds approximately 140 cal; lighter vinaigrette options add approximately 40–60 cal.</p>

  <h2>Related Items</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/items/grilled-chicken-sandwich">Grilled Chicken Sandwich — $7.99, 390 cal (lightest sandwich)</a></li>
    <li><a href="/items/regular-fries">Regular Fries — $2.49 (standard side alternative)</a></li>
    <li><a href="/categories/snacks-sides">All DQ Snacks &amp; Sides</a></li>
  </ul>
