<h2>Crispy Chicken Strips Salad Bowl — The Full Salad Meal</h2>
<p>If you want a salad as your main meal rather than a side, DQ offers a <strong>Crispy Chicken Strips Salad Bowl</strong> at $9.49 (~470 cal). It includes mixed greens, crispy chicken strips, tomatoes, cheese, and dressing — a complete meal in a bowl. The Side Salad at $3.29 is strictly a side; the Salad Bowl is the full-meal option on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
